# inkrot

Schema-driven documentation validation plugin for Claude Code. Enforces structure, naming, frontmatter, and status lifecycle across {{SCHEMA_COUNT}} document types — all derived from JSON schemas as the single source of truth.

## Installation

```
/plugin marketplace add obzenner/inkrot
/plugin install inkrot@inkrot
```

